  "notes": "Released twelve days after GPT-5.4 in its own post, so it has its own record; GPT-5.4 nano, released with it, is an inline variant. OpenAI describes the two as bringing many strengths of GPT-5.4 to faster, more efficient models, and calls nano the smallest version of GPT-5.4; no variant-of relation to GPT-5.4 is recorded because mini is a separately named tier. Knowledge cutoff per the API docs: Aug 31, 2025."
